<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.3 points to 824.9 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.3 points to 824.9 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 2.3 points on Thursday to 824.9, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Four of the ten sectoral indices fell, with the construction index losing the most, 9.7 points to 946.6.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
